title: completion:cycle
tags: [[GUI command]] Commands
kind: reference
summary: Cycle the prompt's completion views (forward / back)

Shows the next way (`forward`, the default) or the previous one (`back`) of naming the candidates of the question on the command line, wrapping around; the hint at the right of the line names the view shown. With a single view — the usual case — it does nothing and says nothing. See [[Completion views]].
